\v 4 By faith Hevel¦144825 \add !(Abel¦144825)\add* offered¦144828 a more¦144823 satisfactory sacrifice¦144824 to God than¦144826 Kayin¦144827 \add !(Cain¦144827)\add*,\x + \xo 11:4: \xt Gen 4:3-10.\x* and as a result, he was¦144833 declared to be¦144834 righteous¦144835 when God testified¦144836 about his gifts¦144839, and through¦144847 \add his faith\add*, he still¦144850 speaks¦144852 despite being \add long\add* dead.
