\v 35 Women¦145387 received¦145386 back those who'd died¦145392 and came back to life, and others¦145394 were¦145396 tortured¦145396—not \add relenting\add* so they'd be set free, but¦145395 instead \add looking forward to\add* obtaining¦145405 a better¦145403 \add reward in the next age\add*.\x + \xo 11:35: \xt 1Ki 17:17-24; 2Ki 4:25-37.\x*
