\v 1 So then with us having a cloud¦145490 of witnesses¦145491 around¦145489 us, we¦145484 should discard everything¦145495 that's a burden¦145492, as well as the sin¦145500 that's \add always so\add* near to us. We should run¦145503 the race¦145509 that's ahead of us with endurance¦145502,
