\v 3 You¦145556 all¦145556 need to think about Yeshua and how he persevered when sinners¦145547 quarrelled with him (\add although\add* they \add only\add* hurt themselves¦145552) so that¦145554 you¦145556 can be strong on the¦145557 inside and persevere.
