\v 5 What's more, you've failed to remember what \add Solomon\add* encouraged his children to do, which¦145577 also applies to all of you:\x + \xo 12:5-6: \xt Yob 5:17; Prv 3:11-12 (LXX).\x*
\q1 “My¦145584 child, learn carefully when \nd Yahweh¦145589\nd* trains you.
