\v 9 What's more, our human parents trained us when we were¦145650 children and¦145652 we changed our behaviour, so, we should accept it even more when our spiritual¦145663 father¦145661, \add God, trains us\add* so that we can have¦145650 life.
\v 10 Indeed, they were disciplining¦145678 us for a few days¦145672 according¦145673 to what seemed best to them¦145677, but \add God our father\add* does it for \add our\add* benefit¦145683 so that¦145686 we can \add also distance ourselves from sin\add*.
\v 11 No discipline¦145696 seems pleasant at the¦145700 time, but¦145706 painful, however later¦145708 it¦145714 produces peace¦145711 in those who've been¦145716 trained¦145716 in this way so they do what's good and right¦145718.
